    <rdf:Description xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/" rdf:about="">
      <dc:title>
        <rdf:Alt>
          <rdf:li xml:lang="x-default">Unwanted Animal</rdf:li>
        </rdf:Alt>
      </dc:title>
      <dc:description>
        <rdf:Alt>
          <rdf:li xml:lang="x-default">&lt;p&gt;"She can't keep them all safe, they will die and be afraid. Mother, tell me so I say" - Yaelokre&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Or&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;A serial killer is on the loose on the town of Etheria, leaving blood, violence and animal masks at its trail, targeting all that Adora has ever loved. As the clock runs out of time, she and her friends will have to take a look to her past and a step to her future if she wants to finish what started long ago before they'll all suffocate under the sins that weight over the quiet but dangerous town&lt;/p&gt;</rdf:li>
        </rdf:Alt>
      </dc:description>
      <dc:creator>
